# Phase 171: the troubleshooting button. The owner describes a problem and
# presses SEND; the window closes and the app saves the report (the words,
# its state, the log's last lines and rig.ini with the site and secrets
# removed, and screenshots) and starts the hand-off to Claude Code in the
# background. In the emulator's sandbox the hand-off is not expected to
# reach Claude; the scenario checks the report is saved and the send is
# started.

name    Report a problem: saved and handed off from the app
timeout 90

expect 30  [SCENARIO] Report
wait   3
press  REPORT:SEND The scenario's test report: autofocus went out of focus
expect 15  [REPORT]
shot   after-send
